      "widgets_values": [
        "Anime cel-shaded action shot, 2D hand-drawn look with bold clean linework, vivid saturated colors, dramatic rim lighting, rain-slick reflections. The alligator warrior from <Picture 1> walks slowly forward down a narrow neon-lit alley at night, steam rising from grates, his crimson scarf trailing behind him.\n\nHe keeps exactly the same design as <Picture 1>: green scales, long scarred snout, amber eyes, crimson scarf, bronze shoulder armor.\n\nSingle continuous shot, slow forward tracking, no cuts. Exactly one alligator.\n\nAudio: steady rain on asphalt, distant city traffic, a low synth drone, wet footsteps. No speech, no dialogue, no narration.",
